@startuml SEQ_12_MENGELOLA_ABSENSI
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-12: Mengelola Absensi Praktikum

actor       "Admin / Asisten"            as User
boundary    "Browser"                    as Browser
control     "PraktikumAbsensiController" as Controller
entity      "AbsensiPraktikan Model"     as ModelAP
entity      "AbsensiAslab Model"         as ModelAA
entity      "PertemuanPraktikum Model"   as ModelPR

== Lihat Form Absensi Pertemuan ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Absensi" pada baris pertemuan
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser ->  Controller : GET /pertemuan/{id}/absensi
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelPR  : Query pertemuan + praktikan + aslab + data absensi
ModelPR --> Controller : Data lengkap pertemuan
Controller --> Browser : Render form absensi
Browser    --> User    : Form absensi: tabel praktikan (hadir/alfa/izin/sakit) + tabel aslab

== Simpan Absensi Praktikan ==

User    ->  Browser    : Tandai status absensi semua praktikan, klik "Simpan"
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser ->  Controller : POST /pertemuan/{id}/absensi-praktikan\n{absensi_praktikan}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelAP  : updateOrCreate per praktikan
ModelAP --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Tabel absensi menampilkan status terbaru

== Simpan Absensi Aslab ==

User    ->  Browser    : Tandai status kehadiran aslab, klik "Simpan Kehadiran Aslab"
Browser --> User : response / redirect
Browser ->  Controller : POST /pertemuan/{id}/absensi-aslab {absensi: [{aslab_id, status}, ...]}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelAA  : updateOrCreate per aslab
ModelAA --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Tabel kehadiran aslab ter-update

@enduml